      },
      {
       "text": "FIXED - UI issues;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "FIXED - Objects not getting colored;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enhancements to avoid game break.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "NOTE",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Due to the technical nature of the game, sometimes updates can be quite big compared to the game size already installed, even when the update itself is a small thing. But, make note that this won't increase too much of your install files as it is already.",
